\section{Conclusion}

Under independent failures, corridor survival value is exactly pivotal probability, and the corresponding local cost rule can reverse a deterministic current ranking. The result is useful only within its declared model. It is an exploration awaiting significance review, empirical validation, and formal review---not a new reliability theorem, completed submission package, or conservation prescription.

